; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180): RING OFFSET — the rift ring's half-gap
; twin (10 x 36° at +18°). Alternating with the base ring via the
; one-state-machine slot serialization, the gaps WALK between rings;
; each ring alone keeps full 36° gaps (the Grubb law honored
; sequentially — never two radials in the air by authored cadence).
; Pattern id 31; lead 36. Elite amber-deep.

